---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Software & Automation for Promotional Products Decorators | Swishtag";
const description = "Artwork approval, production workflow and solutions for promotional products decorators.";
const canonical = "https://cms.swishtag.com/industries/promotional-products-decorators/";
const robots = "index,follow";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} robots={robots}>
  <link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/generic-page.css" />
  <main><section class="gp-hero"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-kicker">For decorators</div><h1>Connect artwork approval to the production floor.</h1><p>Decoration operations lose time when order context, artwork decisions, production status and shipping information live in separate places. Swishtag focuses on connecting those handoffs.</p><div class="gp-actions"><a class="gp-btn primary" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a><a class="gp-btn secondary" href="/solutions/">Explore solutions</a></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-section-head"><h2>The floor needs clarity more than another dashboard.</h2><p>A production system is valuable only when it makes the next action obvious and reduces the number of people who have to chase status.</p></div><div class="gp-grid"><article aria-label="Open Promo Plus" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/platforms/promo-plus/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>ARTWORK</small><h3>Promo Plus</h3><p>Centralize customer artwork approvals and production-ready files.</p><a href="/platforms/promo-plus/">Explore artwork workflow →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Xecutor" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/platforms/xecutor/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>PRODUCTION</small><h3>Xecutor</h3><p>Organize production stages, workstation visibility and fulfillment.</p><a href="/platforms/xecutor/">Explore production workflow →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Shopify storefronts" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/solutions/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>COMMERCE</small><h3>Shopify storefronts</h3><p>Use Shopify when a direct or program storefront can create a cleaner ordering experience.</p><a href="/solutions/">Explore Shopify →</a></article></div></div></section><section class="gp-section alt"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-split"><div><h2>What this page will cover</h2></div><div class="gp-list"><div>Keep artwork approval tied to the job.</div><div>Make blocked work visible before it becomes late work.</div><div>Give production teams the information they need at the workstation.</div><div>Connect completed work to packing and shipping.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-cta"><div><h2>Have a workflow that does not fit off-the-shelf software?</h2><p>Show us the current process. We can help identify the simplest Shopify, integration, or automation approach before you commit to a larger build.</p></div><a class="gp-btn" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a></div><p class="gp-note">This page is connected and launch-ready. Detailed sales copy, proof, screenshots and SEO depth can be expanded in the next content pass.</p></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
